### ⚡ 5. Dispatch & Booking Engine (Steps 09–12)
* **Booking Engine** ([`src/app/api/bookings/route.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/app/api/bookings/route.js)): 
  * Atomic sequential sequential-ID builder (`SP` + `YYMMDD` + `4-digit counter`).
  * Generates and hashes 4-digit start/complete validation OTPs.
  * Idempotency filters (ignores identical bookings submitted within 5 mins).
* **State Machine Engine** ([`src/lib/bookingStateMachine.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/lib/bookingStateMachine.js)): Validates progress through all booking statuses.
* **Scoring Service** ([`src/services/scoringService.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/services/scoringService.js)): Computes match scores for online candidate professionals based on distance (Haversine formula), ratings, experience, reliability (completion rates), and workload.
* **Dispatch Service** ([`src/services/dispatchService.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/services/dispatchService.js)): Notifies top candidates in order with a 3-minute response deadline. Reverts to manual dispatch if candidates decline, and triggers cancellation and auto-refunds after a 15-minute global timeout.

### 💰 6. Pricing, Coupons & Payments (Steps 13–15)
* **Pricing Engine** ([`src/services/pricingEngine.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/services/pricingEngine.js)): Strictly computes convenience fees, GST, coupon discounts, platform revenue, and professional payouts in integer paise.
* **Coupon Manager** ([`src/services/couponService.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/services/couponService.js)): Validates order thresholds, service scopes, usage limits, and first-booking-only flags.
* **Razorpay Payment Service** ([`src/services/paymentService.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/services/paymentService.js)): Integrates order generation, HMAC verification, captured transactions logs, and background dispatch hooks. Configures clean offline mock fallback when dummy environment credentials are used.

### 🔄 7. Refunds & Bank Payouts (Steps 16–17)
* **Cancellation & Refund Handler** ([`src/services/cancellationService.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/services/cancellationService.js)): Enforces fee boundaries:
  * Cancel > 4h: Free (100% refund).
  * Cancel <= 4h / in-transit: ₹100 fee.
  * Cancel post-arrival: ₹150 fee.
  * Cancel post-start: Strictly Forbidden.
  * Payout reversals can be routed to original payment gateway transactions or credited to the customer's wallet ledger.
* **Payout batch runner** ([`src/services/payoutService.js`](file:///c:/Client4-%28SParky%29/src/services/payoutService.js)): Registers bank account details to RazorpayX contacts/virtual accounts and issues bulk payouts to all active professionals with pending balances.

